      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GRAMERCY GARRY (1) was out of the placings last time but shapes well for this on his speedy win a few runs back, getting around this track over 457m in 25.39. Hot win three back and looks the one to beat here. MOET MAGIC (8) missed the frame last time when fourth (42.49) at Q Parklands but prior to that had three placings in a row. Form here sound including seven wins. The form out of her last race has been franked. Can do much better this time. RUN THE GAUNTLET (6) has some solid form under his belt and proved too classy last time to win by 7 lengths at Q Parklands in a handy 41.38 beating Classy Hunter. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Can continue on with his winning form. ",
